abstract: "100 real Chinese web tasks (search/ecom/form/gov/map/media) with a polite harness (≤1rps), semantic asserts, and a deterministic 7-class failure taxonomy. Overall pass 68/100 (68.0%, Wilson CI 58.3%–76.3%); failures F6×14, F3×8; retry rescue 1/32 (3.1%); domain×outcome chi²=21.216 p=0.0007."
